OMP Desktop
===========

OMP Desktop is based on vastsa/PI-Desktop v0.18.0:
https://github.com/vastsa/PI-Desktop/tree/v0.18.0

The upstream PI-Desktop authors and contributors retain their rights and
attribution. The original GNU Lesser General Public License version 3
(LGPL-3.0), provided in LICENSE, is preserved for this modified work.

The OMP Desktop modifications integrate oh-my-pi (omp) as the agent engine
and adapt desktop sessions, settings, native tools, storage isolation,
packaging, security and localization. This is a modified fork, not an
upstream PI-Desktop release.

Corresponding public source for OMP Desktop, including build scripts and
modifications:
https://github.com/Emmeet/PI-Desktop
https://github.com/Emmeet/PI-Desktop/tree/feat/omp-support

When distributing a binary, provide its exact source revision from this
public fork together with the corresponding source/build instructions,
LICENSE and this NOTICE. A moving branch alone does not identify the exact
source revision of a binary. Preserve all applicable upstream and third-party
license and copyright notices. Third-party components remain under their
respective licenses; this notice does not replace those terms.
